Mon Nov 23 01:39:18 UTC 2026 - Steve Kowalik <steven.kowalik@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0:
  * Drop Python 3.9/3.10 and Sphinx < 7.2; support Python 3.14 and
    Sphinx 7.2-9
  * Update Material Design Icons and Octicons (v19.8.0 to v19.42.0),
    and allow flit_core < 5
  * Generate stylesheet as plain CSS without Sass (deriving hover
    shades via color-mix()), and serve static assets only for HTML
  * Add accordion, aside, steps/step, and vertical tab-set directives
  * Add card-header/card-footer directives and :header:/:footer:
    options; deprecate ^^^ and +++ card separators (design.card_legacy)
  * Add link-new-tab on cards and new-tab on button-link/button-ref
  * Add badge tooltips via ; tooltip suffix and :tooltip: role option
  * Add FontAwesome v6 roles, sd_fontawesome_source/cdn_url/version,
    and "fontawesome5" mode for sd_fontawesome_latex
  * Persist tab selections in localStorage (sd_tabs_storage_prefix),
    open tabs from URL hash fragments, and sync tabs on keyboard/drag
  * Support line blocks in button-link/button-ref and preserve button
    styling/links across gettext translations
  * Add sphinx_design.testing.normalize_doctree_xml helper and remove
    private sphinx_design._compat.findall
  * Restore :focus-visible rings, add aria-controls on tab labels,
    and adjust tab hover opacity
  * Validate sd_* settings in one typed config (design.config)
  * Fix tab-set non-tab children, comments/targets inside grids/
    carousels/tabs, and multi-word ref targets in buttons and cards
  * Fix icon SVG leakage into toctree/search, article-info spacing,
    sd-card-text class handling, and spurious _sphinx_design_static
- Drop patch regenerate-snippets-docutils-0.22.patch, no longer required.

